team/apps/1985520/extras/81cd26e81e9b4cb4c4dbc55fd09eda38.webm?t=1671093006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985520/extras/81cd26e81e9b4cb4c4dbc55fd09eda38.mp4?t=1671093006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
